In vanilla: A shopkeeper will grab your pack if it is at most 5 tiles
away from you in both x and y direction and can "jump" adjacent  to
you the moment you fall through. They will walk to you while you dig
with a slow implement. Tricks: dig with a wand; block the shopkeeper
with boulders from a scroll of earth, or with the Kops by digging
horizontally and stepping out first.


