Probably most players would be more successful at the game if the full-
inventory-effect were removed from scrolls of identify. Waiting for
that is a very bad habit. Instead, you might want to price-ID and use-
test things so you can narrow down your identify needs to those few
items that could really change your game, and read an uncursed scroll
on them.

