I've lost a few successful vanilla speed run attempts to Orcus'
shades. Magic cancellation three or free action are the key to make
shades near-harmless. It's best to avoid them, though. A drum or horn
really helps with that. Alternatively, you could engrave Elbereth, but
since shades are slow, you'll be stuck on that square for a long time.


